iv class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>James_Willoughby</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1516235-is-there-any-talks-about-revising-vancouver-by-night-anytime-soon-or-down-the-road?p=1517751#post1517751\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The simple solution would to be to write <i>Dark Alliance: Vancouver</i> second edition for the Storyteller's Vault.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like that idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28074-doktor-von-zwitter","name":"Doktor von Zwitter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28074_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-16T09:06:58-07:00","id":1518144,"title":"","content":"I don't recall the name, but there is a Storyteller's Vault supplement that someone made to update the Vancouver setting (here it is: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/361484/Soul-Fire\" target=\"_blank\">Soul Fire - White Wolf | Storytellers Vault</a>\u200b).<br /> <br /> I've been casually puttering on an updated version of the Vancouver setting myself, but it's very much a back-burner project due to an uncontrollable wandering attention-span. I didn't quite like the sound of the Vault supplement, from the introduction publicly available, but I'll probably check it out at some point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/